  "name": "Cross-Border Payment Cost Check",
  "outcome": "Recompute a cross-border B2B payment's true all-in cost in three independent stages: itemize the invoice's cost stack (FX spread, method fee, VAT/reverse-charge, documentary-credit, reconciliation) as a percentage of invoice value (ART-367), recompute the corridor's declared cost gap against the hardcoded G20/FSB roadmap targets for the declared year (ART-549), then model the same corridor on a USDC stablecoin rail to show the cheaper alternative (ART-250), closing with a session receipt aggregating the run's execution hashes (CRY-05). Every figure is caller-declared; no live FX or rate calls. Not FX advice.",
